11
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Prey is a 2022 American science fiction action horror film directed by Dan Trachtenberg from
a screenplay by Patrick Aison, based on a story by Aison and Trachtenberg.

12
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
It is the fifth installment in the Predator film series.

13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
The story takes place chronologically before the previous films,
as it is set in the Northern Great Plains in 1719.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
It stars Amber Midthunder, Dakota Beavers, Dane DiLiegro, Michelle Thrush,
Stormee Kipp, Julian Black Antelope, and Bennett Taylor.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The story revolves around a young Comanche woman, Naru, who
is striving to prove herself as a hunter.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
She finds herself having to protect her people from a vicious,
humanoid alien that hunts humans for sport.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
Development of the film began during the production of The Predator (2018), when producer John Davis was
approached by Trachtenberg and Aison, with a concept that they had been developing since 2016.

18
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
In late 2020, the film's title was revealed.

19
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
Principal photography took place around Calgary during the summer of 2021, with most of the film
being filmed in English, with some sequences being shot in Comanche and French as well.

20
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
A full Comanche language dub was provided for the film, with the cast reprising
their roles, thus making it the first feature film to do so.

21
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Prey premiered at San Diego Comic-Con on July 21, 2022, and was released by 20th
Century Studios as a Hulu original film in the United States on August 5.

22
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film received positive reviews from critics and high viewership, leading Trachtenberg to direct two
additional Predator films, Predator: Killer of Killers and Predator: Badlands, both released in 2025.

23
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:06,000
The film explores themes of hunter, native
american, alien life-form, alien, prequel.

24
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
